1
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,799
You really taught me a good lesson today.

2
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:40,359
What it means to use A sledgehammer to crack a nut.

3
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:41,439
Lawyer Ding.

4
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:45,400
Lawyer Ding, thank you so much.

5
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,760
With your qualifications, I never expected...

6
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,439
...you'd take on such a small case.

7
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:48,239
Duqi Song.

8
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:50,480
Let me give you some serious advice.

9
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,239
Go ahead.

10
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:52,400
You know,

11
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,680
instead of putting all this energy into sucking up,

12
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,359
you'd be better off saving it

13
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,159
to rediscover the reason why, in your youth,

14
00:01:58,159 --> 00:02:01,319
you chose to become a lawyer.

15
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,920
Think about it carefully.

16
00:02:09,719 --> 00:02:11,919
Those small law firms wouldn't even take our case.

17
00:02:11,919 --> 00:02:12,879
Only you were willing to take it.

18
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,599
And you even won the lawsuit for us.

19
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,520
Thank you so much.

20
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,560
Attorney Ding, I'm really ashamed to say this.

21
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,439
But during the process, I was worried...

22
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,560
...since you're a young woman...

23
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,719
...I was afraid you couldn't handle it.

24
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,639
What are you talking about?

25
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,719
I misspoke, my bad.

26
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,120
You see,

27
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,599
seeing your demeanor in court just now...

28
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:25,560
You were amazing.

29
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,919
And to think we even gave you a hard time.

30
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,039
I'm so sorry, Lawyer Ding.

31
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,479
It's my job.

32
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,120
Oh, right.

33
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,919
We also need to thank that lawyer, Zhao Yijie.

34
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,800
He even found Lin a new job.

35
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,680
Did you know? Right, right, right.

36
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,240
You two are really our lifesavers.

37
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,840
We'll never forget you as long as we live.

38
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,120
Honey, how about this?

39
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,400
I'll make the arrangements today, my treat.

40
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,560
Let's have a nice meal to celebrate.

41
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,719
It's time to eat.

42
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:43,520
Let's go eat.

43
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,360
Right.

44
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,120
Yang A'wu.

45
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,919
So...

46
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,319
You're Lu Zhiyong's friend?

47
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,240
You know him too?

48
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,639
Yes.

49
00:02:59,439 --> 00:03:01,319
I haven't seen Xiao Lu for days.

50
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,199
Do you know where he went?

51
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,759
He went...

52
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:09,479
He went to a quiet place.

53
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:12,159
A quiet place?

54
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:16,240
Then do you know when he'll be back?

55
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,240
I don't know.

56
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:20,199
I don't know how long he'll be gone.

57
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,719
But I'll wait for him.

58
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:24,199
When he comes back,

59
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,159
I'm going to take him to do many things.

60
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,759
By the way,

61
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,800
do you know what Xiao Lu usually does?

62
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,479
He likes dropping by people's houses.

63
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,879
He's amazing.

64
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,439
He took me to several houses.

65
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,080
One time,

66
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,039
we met an

67
00:03:43,039 --> 00:03:44,439
old man who couldn't walk.

68
00:03:44,719 --> 00:03:47,719
We jumped on a trampoline and played in the water.

69
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,360
He also likes eating Old-style yogurt.

70
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,240
So he just likes doing these things.

71
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:56,639
So happiness can be that simple.

72
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:58,240
When he comes back,

73
00:03:58,759 --> 00:04:00,520
I'll definitely show him something different.

74
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,759
Where are you going to take him?

75
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,919
I'll let him live in my big house,

76
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:06,159
and bring all his family over.

77
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,159
I'll let him see the whole world,

78
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,919
and eat the most delicious food in the world,

79
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,080
miles better than Old-style yogurt.

80
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,280
I want

81
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:17,279
to free him from being submissive

82
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:18,399
and taking orders from others.

83
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,560
Let him do

84
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,079
what he truly wants to do.

85
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,600
You two are so close.

86
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:25,839
Waiting for his return

87
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:29,040
is the only hope in my life now.

88
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,120
How did you two meet?

89
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:34,920
How come Xiao Lu never mentioned you?

90
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,600
We haven't known each other for long.

91
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,120
But after knowing him, I realized

92
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,279
how brave he is,

93
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,480
and how cowardly I am.

94
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:01,240
Don't be nervous.

95
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,160
Let me do it.

96
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:20,079
Only then did I realize that my past life

97
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,720
was so selfish,

98
00:05:24,079 --> 00:05:25,079
and so absurd.

99
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,319
I don't understand.

100
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,839
Since you two are friends,

101
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,639
then we're friends too.

102
00:05:43,879 --> 00:05:44,639
I'm Kevin.

103
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,639
I'm Yang A'wu.

104
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:50,040
The stuff Xiao Lu did before,

105
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,319
how about you walk me through it again?

106
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,639
I should head back.

107
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:58,560
Let me take you out to eat.

108
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,800
No, thanks.

109
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,519
Otherwise, Grandpa will get worried.

110
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:05,680
Let me take you back.

111
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,519
It's not safe for a kid to be alone.

112
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,240
Oh, right.

113
00:06:14,879 --> 00:06:16,079
Do you know how to play this?

114
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,560
Did Xiao Lu give you this?

115
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,959
Yes, I'm keeping it safe for him.

116
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:28,959
Xiao Lu loves listening to it.

117
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,560
I'll play it for you.

118
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:31,600
Okay.

119
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:56,720
Citizens have reported to our station

120
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,439
that around Wenhua Community and nearby parks,

121
00:06:58,439 --> 00:07:01,959
unknown youths frequently break into homes.

122
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:04,439
Many residents are panicked by this.

123
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:06,600
In accordance with laws regarding minors,

124
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,240
we will temporarily withhold releasing

125
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,120
images of the two involved minors.

126
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:12,199
If the public has any relevant clues,

127
00:07:12,199 --> 00:07:13,720
please dial 110

128
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,439
or contact the local police anonymously.

129
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,000
Awu.

130
00:07:18,199 --> 00:07:18,800
Awu.

131
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:22,800
Awu.

132
00:07:49,199 --> 00:07:50,199
Hello, Ding Ning.

133
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,000
Lao Yu, why are you only picking up now?

134
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,079
Is Awu home?

135
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,800
Weren't you supposed to pick him up today?

136
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,399
I got held up with something.

137
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,079
But when I went to the school gate,

138
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,120
he was already gone.

139
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,680
Did he go back to your place by himself?

140
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:06,680
Then why didn't you call me?

141
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:09,319
I kept calling you, but you didn't answer!

142
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,680
Alright, enough talk.

143
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:12,720
I'm hanging up.

144
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,480
Go ahead and ask.

145
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,720
I know you have a lot of questions.

146
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:16,039
Why did you want

147
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:18,840
to defend Mrs. Lin's family in court yourself?

148
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,120
First of all,

149
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,519
you picked a very good case.

150
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:24,200
On December 28th of last year,

151
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,519
the new guidelines that were issued

152
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:26,120
brought about many

153
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:28,720
revised judgments for DUI cases like Lin's.

154
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,440
So I understand that

155
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,480
no matter which one of us went to court,

156
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,559
Mrs. Lin's family was guaranteed to win.

157
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:37,919
What else?

158
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Fuxia Group ending up like this

159
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,120
was never my intention.

160
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,480
If I can do more for their employees,

161
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:48,080
I will do it.

162
00:09:49,519 --> 00:09:50,679
So I went myself,

163
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:52,759
not just for Mrs. Lin's family,

164
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:54,639
but also so

165
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:56,399
I could feel a little better about it.

166
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:59,360
Where did you go when you disappeared?

167
00:10:04,879 --> 00:10:06,480
You must have your own guesses.

168
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,399
Let's hear them.

169
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,919
The Sham Litigation Factory was shut down.

170
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,600
Logically speaking,

171
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,080
you and the interns at our law firm

172
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,440
should have been implicated.

173
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:18,480
You'd be investigated and held accountable.

174
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,840
But every one of you is safe and sound.

175
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:22,799
So you and the Prosecutor's Office,

176
00:10:22,799 --> 00:10:24,919
or other government agencies,

177
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,759
reached some kind of deal.

178
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:27,919
Right?

179
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,559
From your perspective,

180
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,519
you'd definitely think

181
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,639
working with the Prosecutor's Office is safest.

182
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,399
But I'm different from you.

183
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,279
When a person gets close to power,

184
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:48,879
when power can, like sunlight,

185
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:50,000
shine down on you,

186
00:10:50,039 --> 00:10:51,759
many things you thought were impossible

187
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,360
are exactly what end up happening.

188
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,559
Mr. Bi helped you.

189
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,320
I promised you that if you helped me

190
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:05,720
with the Sham Litigation Factory,

191
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:08,559
I'd introduce you to Mr. Bi.

192
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,360
I failed to do that back then.

193
00:11:11,639 --> 00:11:13,360
Some things happened after the New Year,

194
00:11:13,679 --> 00:11:15,399
and the situation changed again.

195
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,399
So,

196
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,000
during the time I disappeared,

197
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,360
the second thing I did

198
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:22,480
was secure an opportunity for you.

199
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:28,840
Sounds like joining Mr. Bi and his people

200
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,519
comes with other conditions.

201
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:31,480
Yes.

202
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,919
A juvenile intentional homicide case.

203
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,279
I'm giving it to you.

204
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,399
Giving it to me again?

205
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,559
How are you sure that after I finish it,

206
00:11:40,559 --> 00:11:42,159
it won't be like the sham litigation,

207
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,600
where I still can't join you,

208
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,840
and still can't meet Mr. Bi

209
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,679
and those other so-called elders?

210
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,919
Be patient.

211
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,039
This is the final test.

212
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:00,840
Fine.

213
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:03,320
But I have one condition.

214
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:13,000
I mean, you two weirdos,

215
00:12:13,559 --> 00:12:15,480
you aren't blood relatives, are you?

216
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,519
Yu Songfan.

217
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:20,879
Your condition is

218
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,639
to leave him out of it,

219
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:26,200
and never disrupt his life again.

220
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:27,639
Yes.

221
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:33,360
Everyone is on guard against smart people,

222
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:36,840
thinking intelligence is a weapon.

223
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:41,080
But later, I saw in Yu Songfan that

224
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,279
kindness

225
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,840
is the greatest intelligence of all.

226
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:53,759
The kid is named Lu Zhiyong.

227
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:58,360
Read the rest in the case file yourself.

228
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,120
Hey guys, let me tell you.

229
00:13:18,799 --> 00:13:22,399
My house was broken into last winter.

230
00:13:22,399 --> 00:13:23,679
There were two thieves.

231
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:26,279
Over the holidays, he killed someone.

232
00:13:26,759 --> 00:13:28,039
I'm really scared right now.

233
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,240
Who knows if the one who wasn't caught...

234
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:32,039
...is that murderer's accomplice?

235
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:33,559
And then?

236
00:13:33,559 --> 00:13:34,720
Did they find that accomplice?

237
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:36,240
After all, our dear police officers...

238
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:38,159
...are really very kind.

239
00:13:39,039 --> 00:13:41,039
Especially that officer, a certain Fan.

240
00:13:41,039 --> 00:13:43,200
He's a good and responsible guy.

241
00:13:43,679 --> 00:13:44,519
How interesting.

242
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:46,639
Many influencers are checking in outside.

243
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:48,200
They all keep coming over to ask...

244
00:13:48,279 --> 00:13:49,480
...about the progress of our investigation.

245
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:52,240
Xiao Fan,

246
00:13:52,759 --> 00:13:54,279
Director Cao gave me a call.

247
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,720
What he meant was...

248
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:57,080
...if the media comes for an interview,

249
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,320
...it'd be best if you made an appearance.

250
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,919
Just share the basic details of the case...

251
00:14:00,919 --> 00:14:01,720
...and the progress of the investigation.

252
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:02,519
I can't do it.

253
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:03,440
This...

254
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,759
Besides, a lot of what's online...

255
00:14:04,759 --> 00:14:06,639
...are videos edited by that vlogger.

256
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,639
It's just total nonsense!

257
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:08,519
Captain,

258
00:14:09,559 --> 00:14:11,000
Lu Zhiyong isn't a thief at all.

259
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,159
And he certainly didn't kill anyone.

260
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:12,840
Fan Dong,

261
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,840
don't give me this nonsense.

262
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,279
If it weren't for this stupid video,

263
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:18,039
you wouldn't even be involved in this.

264
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:18,759
I'm not going.

265
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:21,879
I can't even convince myself.

266
00:14:23,679 --> 00:14:25,519
Then how do you plan to convince yourself?

267
00:14:26,399 --> 00:14:27,879
Let me join Lu Zhiyong's case.

268
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,559
I want to see him again.

269
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,399
Are you picking a fight with me?

270
00:14:31,679 --> 00:14:32,679
If you don't do this interview,

271
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:34,000
do you think we can't handle this case?

272
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,399
You think you're all that?

273
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:36,799
Captain Sun, Captain Sun, please calm down.

274
00:14:36,799 --> 00:14:37,799
I didn't mean that.

275
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:38,679
Have a seat.

276
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:39,480
Tell you what.

277
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,799
Fan Dong, you guys step outside for a bit.

278
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,240
Let's talk this over.

279
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:45,840
Thank you, Captain.

280
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,039
Let's go back.

281
00:15:12,039 --> 00:15:13,159
No more school, okay?

282
00:15:13,159 --> 00:15:14,159
What's wrong, Grandpa?

283
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,879
Let's go. No more school.

284
00:15:15,879 --> 00:15:17,480
We're not going. Listen to me.

285
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,080
No school today. Be good.

286
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:21,320
Be good, be good.

287
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,320
What do you want to drink?

288
00:15:43,679 --> 00:15:44,759
How about this?

289
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:46,159
Here.

290
00:15:49,879 --> 00:15:50,639
Awu.

291
00:15:51,559 --> 00:15:53,559
You're not going back to school this week.

292
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:55,720
Grandpa will get you excused.

293
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,919
I'll call your teacher.

294
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,120
Grandpa will teach you at home, okay?

295
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:03,919
Anyone home?

296
00:16:04,639 --> 00:16:06,000
Hello? Is anyone there?

297
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,200
I'm the downstairs neighbor.

298
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:10,120
Grandpa, it's the neighbor.

299
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,919
Come here. Come on, come here.

300
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,480
Come here. Listen to me.

301
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:16,240
Don't make a sound.

302
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:19,960
We have to make him think no one's home.

303
00:16:20,759 --> 00:16:21,919
Then he'll leave.

304
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:24,080
Sit down. Sit down, sit down.

305
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:38,399
Awu, I need to tell you something.

306
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,240
It's very serious.

307
00:16:40,879 --> 00:16:42,320
When you and Xiao Lu

308
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,720
didn't ask for permission

309
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:47,559
and picked a lock to visit someone's house.

310
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:49,559
That was wrong.

311
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:50,960
Do you understand?

312
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,480
Right now, some adults are very angry.

313
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,600
They're looking everywhere for you two.

314
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,879
Xiao Lu has been found.

315
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,720
And he can't come back.

316
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:05,640
Will they hit him?

317
00:17:07,359 --> 00:17:08,000
No.

318
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,079
But Xiao Lu

319
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,640
has to be like your dad, Lao Kang.

320
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,480
He has to stay somewhere for a while.

321
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:18,160
To help him understand

322
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,079
that what he did

323
00:17:21,119 --> 00:17:21,920
was wrong.

324
00:17:23,279 --> 00:17:24,279
Just like Papa?

325
00:17:28,759 --> 00:17:30,920
Why does everyone go there?

326
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,519
Will you and Zhao Yijie go there too?

327
00:17:42,279 --> 00:17:43,319
It's possible.

328
00:17:45,599 --> 00:17:46,400
Let me ask you this.

329
00:17:47,319 --> 00:17:49,440
If Zhao Yijie goes in,

330
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:52,000
and it brings your dad, Lao Kang, back,

331
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,200
would you want that?

332
00:17:55,799 --> 00:17:56,960
Nobody should go in.

333
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,119
And Papa should come out.

334
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:04,319
I mean if someone has to go in.

335
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:08,519
It's possible even I might have to go in.

336
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:10,839
In the end,

337
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,440
who do you want to be with?

338
00:18:14,079 --> 00:18:15,759
Lao Kang? Ding Ning?

339
00:18:19,359 --> 00:18:20,480
Will you go in too?

340
00:18:24,119 --> 00:18:25,519
Can I go with you then?

341
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,480
I want to be with you.

342
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:40,279
Okay.

343
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,440
We'll be together, together.

344
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,839
No one can separate the two of us.

345
00:19:32,119 --> 00:19:33,160
Bus stop

346
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,359
Then get ready to call a cab

347
00:19:41,359 --> 00:19:42,759
Call a cab in one minute

348
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:53,359
Route 33 bus stop

349
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:57,200
Route 33 bus stop

350
00:20:03,319 --> 00:20:04,680
Bus

351
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,519
Route 33

352
00:20:10,079 --> 00:20:11,000
Long time no see.

353
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:14,960
How was the cake?

354
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,279
Just joking with you.

355
00:20:17,279 --> 00:20:18,160
What are you doing here?

356
00:20:20,279 --> 00:20:21,640
I'm here to take Awu home.

357
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,599
Don't even think about it.

358
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:23,839
Stay right there.

359
00:20:24,519 --> 00:20:25,200
Listen,

360
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:27,200
Awu didn't go to school today.

361
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,480
And you didn't even tell me.

362
00:20:28,519 --> 00:20:29,960
You're really pushing it, aren't you?

363
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:31,960
I'll say this one last time.

364
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:34,359
Awu is my own grandson.

365
00:20:34,839 --> 00:20:35,799
I will raise him.

366
00:20:35,799 --> 00:20:37,960
I decide if he goes to school.

367
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:39,839
Look how sick you are.

368
00:20:39,839 --> 00:20:42,039
How can you raise him? How?

369
00:20:43,079 --> 00:20:44,160
What does that matter?

370
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,559
It's my business.

371
00:20:45,759 --> 00:20:46,440
Doesn't matter.

372
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,160
Right.

373
00:20:49,079 --> 00:20:50,079
Doesn't matter, huh?

374
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,599
Thursday, you go to the hospital.

375
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,000
Today, you take your pills.

376
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,880
At 8:30 and 12:00.

377
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:01,359
Wear a coat when you go out.

378
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:04,359
You can't even remember to wear a coat.

379
00:21:04,359 --> 00:21:06,039
And you say you can raise a child?

380
00:21:07,319 --> 00:21:09,519
I'll never feel safe leaving Awu with you.

381
00:21:09,519 --> 00:21:10,960
I'm taking him with me today.

382
00:21:11,559 --> 00:21:12,680
You just want to take Awu

383
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:14,079
away from me, don't you?

384
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,119
Why?

385
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:17,559
I get it now.

386
00:21:17,559 --> 00:21:18,920
While you were gone,

387
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:21,440
you were planning how to get rid of me.

388
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:23,160
To send me to a nursing home.

389
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:24,519
To use your connections

390
00:21:24,519 --> 00:21:25,759
to keep me locked up,

391
00:21:25,759 --> 00:21:26,720
locked up for good.

392
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:29,440
Then you'll take Awu abroad, right?

393
00:21:30,359 --> 00:21:31,400
Why do you...

394
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:33,519
Why must you take my last hope

395
00:21:33,519 --> 00:21:34,400
away from me?

396
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,480
Lao Yu.

397
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:39,119
I won't argue with you anymore, okay?

398
00:21:39,119 --> 00:21:40,000
Calm down.

399
00:21:40,279 --> 00:21:41,319
Look, look, look, look.

400
00:21:41,319 --> 00:21:41,920
I'll leave. I'll leave.

401
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:42,920
I'll go, alright?

402
00:21:43,039 --> 00:21:44,000
Go. Go. Go.

403
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:46,160
I'll give you a few days to think it over.

404
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,599
Let me know when you figure it out.

405
00:21:47,599 --> 00:21:48,960
Go, go, go!

406
00:21:49,279 --> 00:21:49,920
Just go!

407
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:50,640
Lao Yu,

408
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:53,759
you should look in the mirror more often.

409
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,000
Get out!

410
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:55,759
Maybe one day,

411
00:21:55,759 --> 00:21:57,640
you'll even forget your own face.

412
00:21:57,640 --> 00:21:58,160
Get out!

413
00:21:58,160 --> 00:21:58,960
Take this.

414
00:21:58,960 --> 00:22:00,119
Remember to wear a coat.

415
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,519
My name is Yu Songfan.

416
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:19,720
My grandson's name is Yang A'wu.

417
00:22:22,079 --> 00:22:23,400
My name is Yu Songfan.

418
00:22:26,279 --> 00:22:27,920
My grandson's name is Yang A'wu.

419
00:22:28,759 --> 00:22:30,079
My name is Yu Songfan.

420
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:34,599
My grandson's name is Yang A'wu.

421
00:22:46,079 --> 00:22:46,920
Hello, Ding Ning.

422
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:47,920
Zhou Hao.

423
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,799
That burglary case you handled

424
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:51,880
for Xiao Lu didn't get a case filing.

425
00:22:52,039 --> 00:22:54,160
Said it didn't meet case filing standards?

426
00:22:54,319 --> 00:22:56,079
Yes, I remember it clearly.

427
00:22:56,079 --> 00:22:57,279
The investigating officer at the time

428
00:22:57,279 --> 00:22:58,880
checked several surveillance videos

429
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:00,119
and confirmed that the kid

430
00:23:00,119 --> 00:23:01,599
didn't commit any burglary at all.

431
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,960
He just went over to play.

432
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,480
And when he left,

433
00:23:04,480 --> 00:23:06,039
he even cleaned the place up for them.

434
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:08,319
Then what's the deal with that paralyzed old man?

435
00:23:08,559 --> 00:23:10,039
It's causing an uproar online.

436
00:23:10,039 --> 00:23:12,119
They're calling it an attempted kidnapping.

437
00:23:12,119 --> 00:23:13,359
That family...

438
00:23:13,559 --> 00:23:14,759
They're a real piece of work.

439
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:16,119
Of those who signed the Settlement agreement,

440
00:23:16,119 --> 00:23:17,440
the children of that old man

441
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,640
demanded the most money.

442
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,640
But claiming they lost five thousand bucks

443
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:21,759
was completely fake.

444
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:25,240
Later, for filing a false report to extort,

445
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:26,839
they were given a stern warning.

446
00:23:26,839 --> 00:23:27,599
Got it.

447
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,480
The heat this case is getting online,

448
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,799
if it doesn't die down soon,

449
00:23:30,799 --> 00:23:31,759
our PR department

450
00:23:31,759 --> 00:23:33,039
still needs to have a statement ready.

451
00:23:33,319 --> 00:23:35,119
It'd be best to find the real reason.

452
00:23:35,319 --> 00:23:36,279
Alright, I'm at the detention center.

453
00:23:36,279 --> 00:23:37,319
I've got to let you go.

454
00:23:38,079 --> 00:23:38,880
Lawyer Ding!

455
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:41,079
Please help my son get a sentence reduction!

456
00:23:41,079 --> 00:23:42,480
He's still just a child!

457
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:43,039
I'm begging you!

458
00:23:43,039 --> 00:23:44,200
Please don't panic.

459
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:45,480
Let's go inside to talk, okay?

460
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:47,279
Come.

461
00:23:51,599 --> 00:23:52,400
Little Yong.

462
00:24:03,559 --> 00:24:04,359
Xiao Lu.

463
00:24:06,079 --> 00:24:06,759
Hello.

464
00:24:06,799 --> 00:24:08,519
I'm your attorney, Ding Ning.

465
00:24:09,279 --> 00:24:10,440
For everything that happens next,

466
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:12,480
your mom and I will be right here with you.

467
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:14,039
So you don't need to worry about...

468
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,359
Uncle Fan.

469
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:25,880
Let me have a word with him.

470
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:30,720
Okay.

471
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:34,440
Do I need to step out?

472
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:35,160
No need.

473
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:45,599
Where did you go on February 9th?

474
00:24:46,079 --> 00:24:46,920
And what did you do?

475
00:24:48,319 --> 00:24:50,160
I've already answered that five times.

476
00:24:51,119 --> 00:24:52,240
Please cooperate.

477
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:56,400
I went to the bus stop to catch a bus.

478
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:58,960
And then I ran into him.

479
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,119
Who is he?

480
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:01,599
The guy I stabbed to death.

481
00:25:03,079 --> 00:25:03,920
He cursed at me,

482
00:25:04,759 --> 00:25:05,839
so I got into a fight with him.

483
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,359
I accidentally stabbed him to death.

484
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:09,799
I went to your house at that time.

485
00:25:10,359 --> 00:25:11,799
The food was still hot.

486
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:17,079
My mom made the food.

487
00:25:22,119 --> 00:25:22,759
Okay.

488
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:24,400
Do you remember

489
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:26,599
what time you fought the victim?

490
00:25:26,799 --> 00:25:27,839
Probably sometime past ten.

491
00:25:27,839 --> 00:25:29,240
How do you remember it so clearly?

492
00:25:29,559 --> 00:25:30,920
About two hours later,

493
00:25:31,319 --> 00:25:32,200
fireworks went off.

494
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,480
It was the New Year's countdown.

495
00:25:37,079 --> 00:25:38,200
They were huge, weren't they?

496
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:42,039
What took you guys so long?

497
00:25:43,039 --> 00:25:43,839
An emergency.

498
00:25:44,839 --> 00:25:46,599
It's New Year's. What kind of emergency?

499
00:25:49,799 --> 00:25:50,880
On New Year's Eve...

500
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,279
Is there a problem?

501
00:25:57,319 --> 00:25:58,119
No.

502
00:26:04,319 --> 00:26:05,119
Lu Zhiyong.

503
00:26:06,519 --> 00:26:07,880
Why were you wearing an outfit

504
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:09,880
worth over 30,000 yuan to commit murder?

505
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:11,440
Yet at your house,

506
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:13,559
we didn't find any other luxury clothing.

507
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,720
Tell the truth.

508
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:29,240
It was New Year's. I had to dress nice.

509
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:31,839
Did you buy them?

510
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:33,880
Where did you get those clothes?

511
00:26:34,279 --> 00:26:36,000
We had the luxury items authenticated.

512
00:26:36,359 --> 00:26:38,039
They're all real, not replicas.

513
00:26:42,599 --> 00:26:43,440
Say something!

514
00:26:44,839 --> 00:26:46,359
Why are the shoe sizes different?

515
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:47,599
When you committed the crime,

516
00:26:47,599 --> 00:26:48,880
you were wearing size 44 shoes.

517
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:50,279
You usually wear size 42.

518
00:26:50,319 --> 00:26:51,200
Explain that.

519
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:00,400
Stole them.

520
00:27:00,599 --> 00:27:01,640
I stole them.

521
00:27:06,119 --> 00:27:07,079
Stole them?

522
00:27:07,519 --> 00:27:08,519
You stole them?

523
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:10,759
Say you stole them one more time!

524
00:27:11,039 --> 00:27:12,240
Did you really steal them?

525
00:27:12,759 --> 00:27:13,880
Fan Dong, what are you doing?

526
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:16,519
Have you thought about the consequences?

527
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:19,039
Do you think I'm stupid, or are you?

528
00:27:19,079 --> 00:27:20,079
Explain yourself!

529
00:27:20,079 --> 00:27:20,680
Calm down!

530
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:22,400
Lu Zhiyong! Lu Zhiyong!

531
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:24,119
Think carefully before you speak.

532
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:26,119
Why won't you tell the truth?

533
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:28,000
Do you know the consequences of this?

534
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:30,839
I'm sorry about that.

535
00:27:31,279 --> 00:27:33,400
He has been pulling all-nighters for days.

536
00:27:33,640 --> 00:27:34,400
He just had a sudden emotional breakdown.

537
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:35,400
That's why he acted like that.

538
00:27:36,079 --> 00:27:37,160
I'll take responsibility for any issues.

539
00:27:37,319 --> 00:27:38,160
This police officer

540
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,640
has never believed a word Little Yong says.

541
00:27:41,359 --> 00:27:43,279
But since the kid did such a thing,

542
00:27:43,279 --> 00:27:44,559
he deserves to be scolded.

543
00:27:45,319 --> 00:27:46,279
He deserves it.

544
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:48,319
Let me apologize on his behalf first.

545
00:27:48,519 --> 00:27:49,880
He just hates to see the boy ruin his life.

546
00:27:50,119 --> 00:27:51,480
He really feels for Xiao Lu.

547
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,480
That's why he acted that way.

548
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:54,160
And he's a very stubborn guy.

549
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,519
He tells everyone Xiao Lu didn't kill anyone.

550
00:27:55,519 --> 00:27:56,640
And he didn't commit any petty theft either.

551
00:27:57,039 --> 00:27:59,079
He says this kid isn't the type to do this.

552
00:27:59,599 --> 00:28:00,640
I hope you can understand.

553
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:29,759
The primary crime scene

554
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:32,359
was at the bus stop.

555
00:28:34,160 --> 00:28:36,200
Then I'll go to the terminal and ask them

556
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:39,400
to pull that bus's footage from that day.

557
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:41,680
Then we might get footage of them.

558
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:43,440
Footage of them means we have evidence.

559
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:47,759
Exactly.

560
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:56,480
Go to the bus terminal. Ask about Route 33.

561
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,559
Ask about Route 33.

562
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:34,799
What are you doing here?

563
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:38,680
Outsiders aren't allowed in here.

564
00:29:41,960 --> 00:29:43,079
Bus 33.

565
00:29:43,079 --> 00:29:44,759
I want to see the footage for this bus.

566
00:29:45,279 --> 00:29:46,000
The footage?

567
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,319
We're not authorized to view it.

568
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:50,319
I left something on this bus.

569
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:52,160
I want to see if someone took it.

570
00:29:52,799 --> 00:29:54,079
You lost something?

571
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:55,119
When did you lose it?

572
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,480
On New Year's.

573
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,079
On New Year's?

574
00:29:59,079 --> 00:30:00,319
That was a month ago.

575
00:30:00,559 --> 00:30:01,839
A lot of the footage has been overwritten.

576
00:30:01,839 --> 00:30:02,599
You can't view it anyway.

577
00:30:04,559 --> 00:30:05,319
I'll tell you what.

578
00:30:05,319 --> 00:30:06,519
The driver on duty that day is inside.

579
00:30:06,519 --> 00:30:07,680
You can go ask him.

580
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,440
Okay, thank you.

581
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:10,519
Go on, ask him.

582
00:30:42,319 --> 00:30:45,880
Why can't I remember anything?

583
00:31:04,279 --> 00:31:05,920
I have the evidence.

584
00:31:07,039 --> 00:31:08,440
Be good and go home.

585
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:31,200
Zhao Yijie.

586
00:31:31,519 --> 00:31:35,079
You pushed me to this point step by step.

587
00:31:35,799 --> 00:31:36,519
Don't blame me.

588
00:31:37,920 --> 00:31:40,799
I will secure the evidence of your crimes.

589
00:31:51,359 --> 00:31:52,680
Xiao Lu took the fall.

590
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,440
You arranged this too, didn't you?

591
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:56,480
What do you mean?

592
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:57,480
Don't play dumb with me.

593
00:31:58,319 --> 00:31:59,839
What were you doing on New Year's Eve?

594
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,440
Why did you drag Yu Songfan into this?

595
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:02,880
So in your mind,

596
00:32:04,119 --> 00:32:05,319
Yu Songfan is the good guy,

597
00:32:06,079 --> 00:32:07,079
and I'm the bad guy?

598
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:09,240
So you think

599
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:11,240
I've been the one harming him all along?

600
00:32:12,119 --> 00:32:13,400
You forced him into all of it!

601
00:32:14,559 --> 00:32:16,519
From Lao Kang to the sham litigation,

602
00:32:16,759 --> 00:32:18,680
look how far you've pushed him!

603
00:32:19,079 --> 00:32:20,759
Now you're dragging him into a murder case!

604
00:32:21,279 --> 00:32:22,599
What did he ever do to you

605
00:32:22,599 --> 00:32:23,559
for you to destroy him like this?

606
00:32:23,559 --> 00:32:24,680
That's none of your business.

607
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:28,079
Anyway,

608
00:32:29,079 --> 00:32:31,680
you only have two choices now.

609
00:32:32,839 --> 00:32:33,599
Either,

610
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:36,359
rebuild the chain of evidence to save him,

611
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:39,359
or

612
00:32:40,559 --> 00:32:42,759
do as you're told and finish this case,

613
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,400
and I'll take you to meet Mr. Bi.

614
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:51,920
I'll say it again.

615
00:32:52,839 --> 00:32:54,160
I don't force anyone.

616
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,279
You choose.

617
00:33:01,839 --> 00:33:03,240
I want both.

618
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:10,960
Then go ahead and try.

619
00:33:14,319 --> 00:33:15,160
Hello?

620
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,039
Ding Ning?

621
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:19,799
I want to see you.

622
00:33:22,480 --> 00:33:23,680
I have something to tell you.

623
00:33:32,839 --> 00:33:33,720
That's how it happened.

624
00:33:35,119 --> 00:33:36,960
So regarding Lao Kang and Xiao Lu,

625
00:33:37,079 --> 00:33:38,559
I was involved the whole time.

626
00:33:39,079 --> 00:33:40,359
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

627
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,920
Because I thought keeping it from you

628
00:33:43,359 --> 00:33:45,319
was the best way to protect Awu and you.

629
00:33:45,319 --> 00:33:46,640
Of course, now I know

630
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:48,039
I'm just a joke.

631
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:48,960
A joke?

632
00:33:49,759 --> 00:33:51,400
I think I'm more of a joke.

633
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,119
To think that right under my nose,

634
00:33:53,119 --> 00:33:54,119
you and Zhao Yijie did so much

635
00:33:54,119 --> 00:33:55,079
that I knew nothing about.

636
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:57,920
We can join forces and take them down.

637
00:33:58,599 --> 00:34:00,799
And put things back to the way they were.

638
00:34:01,119 --> 00:34:01,799
Go back?

639
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:03,880
Do you think we can ever go back?

640
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:05,599
If you save that kid,

641
00:34:05,599 --> 00:34:06,920
you and Zhao Yijie will go to prison.

642
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:08,559
And then what?

643
00:34:09,079 --> 00:34:09,840
What about Yang A'wu?

644
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:10,840
Who will take care of him?

645
00:34:11,360 --> 00:34:12,599
But if we don't save that kid,

646
00:34:12,719 --> 00:34:13,559
and maintain the status quo,

647
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:14,840
then you'll have to watch helplessly

648
00:34:14,840 --> 00:34:16,599
as those people continue to run rampant.

649
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:17,760
Can you live with that?

650
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:18,519
No, I can't.

651
00:34:18,519 --> 00:34:19,440
Exactly. Of course you can't.

652
00:34:19,440 --> 00:34:20,360
Neither can I.

653
00:34:20,599 --> 00:34:21,119
Let me tell you,

654
00:34:21,119 --> 00:34:21,960
if this were in the past,

655
00:34:22,039 --> 00:34:23,559
I'd have reported you without hesitation

656
00:34:23,559 --> 00:34:24,400
and sent you all to prison.

657
00:34:24,639 --> 00:34:26,440
Then send us to prison.

658
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:29,440
I really don't have much time left, Ding Ning.

659
00:34:33,159 --> 00:34:34,280
Send me, Zhao Yijie,

660
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:36,079
and that Mr. Bi to prison.

661
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:38,440
That is the best way.

662
00:34:39,159 --> 00:34:40,960
I have one more favor to ask of you.

663
00:34:41,519 --> 00:34:43,360
Take care of Awu for me after this, okay?

664
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:45,000
Of course I'll take care of Awu, but...

665
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:52,119
I don't know what to say... I...

666
00:35:03,519 --> 00:35:04,360
Lao Yu,

667
00:35:06,239 --> 00:35:07,559
have you never wondered

668
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:10,199
why I treat Awu so well?

669
00:35:15,599 --> 00:35:18,760
You raise Yang A'wu like your own grandson.

670
00:35:19,519 --> 00:35:20,920
I can understand why you treat him well.

671
00:35:21,679 --> 00:35:22,519
Zhao Yijie treats him well

672
00:35:22,519 --> 00:35:24,280
because he needs something from you.

673
00:35:26,039 --> 00:35:26,760
But what about me?

674
00:35:35,760 --> 00:35:37,159
Why would I pour so much

675
00:35:37,159 --> 00:35:38,880
affection into a little boy?

676
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:41,239
And no matter what you do,

677
00:35:41,239 --> 00:35:42,840
I'll trust you unconditionally.

678
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:46,039
Don't you find that strange?

679
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:52,920
Sweetie,

680
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:55,880
Dad's taking you to play with a little boy.

681
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:56,320
Okay?

682
00:35:56,480 --> 00:35:56,880
Okay!

683
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:04,599
The last person to ask me to watch a kid

684
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:08,039
was my father.

685
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,239
Not the one who was a detective,

686
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,480
but the one who kidnapped children.

687
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:24,400
Daddy, it's your turn to catch us!

688
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:25,840
That day,

689
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:27,840
he brought me along,

690
00:36:28,639 --> 00:36:29,679
and said in the woods

691
00:36:30,400 --> 00:36:32,440
he'd play hide-and-seek with us.

692
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:35,119
He seeks, we hide.

693
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:37,639
Where are you?

694
00:36:37,719 --> 00:36:39,599
I'm coming to catch you!

695
00:36:41,639 --> 00:36:42,800
Let's hide in this wardrobe.

696
00:36:43,039 --> 00:36:44,760
No, it's too high.

697
00:36:45,079 --> 00:36:46,320
I can't climb up.

698
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:47,880
We found a wardrobe,

699
00:36:48,599 --> 00:36:49,920
thought it was a good spot,

700
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:51,559
and hid in it together.

701
00:36:51,559 --> 00:36:52,599
Step on my back.

702
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:01,239
Are you ready?

703
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:03,840
I'm coming to get you!

704
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,559
There's news from this kid's family.

705
00:37:12,719 --> 00:37:13,480
Call back ASAP.

706
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:35,760
It was very hot and humid that day.

707
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:37,639
I clearly remember

708
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:40,400
there was a mold spot on the cabinet door.

709
00:37:44,159 --> 00:37:46,000
I stared at it, waiting for a long time,

710
00:37:46,559 --> 00:37:48,079
but Dad never came looking for us.

711
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:51,760
He was very heavy.

712
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:57,559
I couldn't hold on much longer,

713
00:37:58,119 --> 00:37:59,760
so I wanted to go out and check.

714
00:38:04,159 --> 00:38:05,079
Dad.

715
00:38:05,880 --> 00:38:06,800
Dad.

716
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:11,719
Dad.

717
00:38:12,639 --> 00:38:13,440
Dad.

718
00:38:26,679 --> 00:38:27,480
Dad.

719
00:38:27,800 --> 00:38:28,559
Wang Ning.

720
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:32,159
Dad, where did you go?

721
00:38:33,159 --> 00:38:33,880
Well, Dad...

722
00:38:33,880 --> 00:38:35,440
Dad just went to make a phone call.

723
00:38:36,679 --> 00:38:37,480
Where's the little boy?

724
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:40,239
The little boy is over there.

725
00:38:49,119 --> 00:38:50,519
By the time I opened the cabinet door,

726
00:38:51,519 --> 00:38:52,880
it was already too late.

727
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:04,639
Dad, why did you put him on the floor?

728
00:39:09,159 --> 00:39:10,280
The little boy got sleepy.

729
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:11,159
He wanted to sleep for a bit.

730
00:39:11,519 --> 00:39:12,559
He wanted to sleep for a bit.

731
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:17,280
Are you sure you want to confess?

732
00:39:19,079 --> 00:39:19,800
I am.

733
00:39:20,599 --> 00:39:22,840
Inform on your accomplice for a sentence reduction.

734
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:25,360
It was just me.

735
00:39:25,880 --> 00:39:26,840
Then sign here.

736
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:53,159
Dad confessed to all the charges,

737
00:39:53,559 --> 00:39:55,119
leaving me completely out of it.
